{
 "how": "Rain (Rain colour 2026-11-14) = a tropical downpour, not a grey filter: every day colour name swapped for its RAIN twin (looks.rain_rgb: hue kept, saturation kept or raised, greens most; value a little lower; a cool blue-teal sky light; whites take the soft blue-violet overcast). Wet ground uses WET (darker, glossier), reflections of what stands on it and of the awning use REFL, wet highlights on leaves, stones and puddle rings use GLOSS. The street lamp is lit (glow colours bot_glow0-2) with a gold streak in the wet stone. Rain streak frames use RAIN stone0 and RAIN water1.",
